 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology (R+O)",
 "title": "5 V uni-directional two-line ESD protection array, 0.6 pF, SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A two-line ESD protector in a SOT-23: each of pins 1 and 2 is an I/O joined by a pair of steering diodes to one shared zener clamp, with pin 3 as ground. Capacitance is 0.6 pF typical from an I/O to ground and 0.3 pF between the two I/Os. Each line stands off 5.0 V, breaks down between 6.0 V and 9.0 V at 1 mA, and clamps at 16 V max carrying a 5 A 8/20 µs surge; ESD withstand to IEC 61000-4-2 is ±25 kV air and ±20 kV contact. Listed uses are automotive: CAN bus and electronic control units for body, ADAS and powertrain.",
